#. +> trunk
#: cryptographypreferences.cpp:51
#| msgid ""
#| "Before you can sign messages or receive encrypted ones, you must select a private key for yourself.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "Before you can send encrypted messages to someone, you must select their public key by right-clicking on their name in your contact list and choosing \"Select Public Key\"."
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>Before you can sign messages or receive encrypted ones, you must select a private key for yourself.</para>"
"<para>Before you can send encrypted messages to someone, you must select their public key by right-clicking on their name in your contact list and choosing \"Select Public Key\".</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Ehr Du Narichten ünnerschrieven oder verslötelt Narichten kriegen kannst, muttst Du Di en Privaatslötel utsöken.</para>"
"<para>Ehr Du anner Lüüd verslötelt Narichten tostüern kannst, muttst Du de Adressareb ehr apen Slötels utsöken. Klick binnen Dien Kontaktenlist mit den rechten Muusknoop op en Adressaat un bruuk \"Apen Slötel utsöken\".</para>"

